Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 17:42:37 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 14/19] MSL: 64-bit image atomics (lock table, device-coherent
 textures), R64i images as ulong, 64-bit subgroup ops

---
 spirv_msl.cpp | 300 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 spirv_msl.hpp |   1 +
 2 files changed, 249 insertions(+), 52 deletions(-)

